tarting Out"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Where Are You From?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people, their likes and dislikes, homes or countries in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking and Saying Where You Are From"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use Wh-question words to get information.<br/> You use the word <span class=\"italic\">Where</span> to find out about a place. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Ask</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Say</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where are you from?<br/><br/> <span class = \\\"italic\\\">Where are you from?<br/>From where in Colombia?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm from ... (place)<br/><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">I'm from Colombia<br/>I'm from Medelin</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Position of Adjectives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use adjectives to describe people, places and things. <br/> <br/>You place adjectives before nouns (people, places and things), or after the verb <span class = \"strong\">to be</span>.<br/>Remember: The short form of He is = <span class = \"italic\">He's</span>; She is = <span class = \"italic\">She's</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Before a Noun</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">After the Verb To Be</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I love <span class =\\\"strong\\\">Japanese</span> food.<br/>My father has <span class =\\\"strong\\\">black </span>hair.<br/>He's a <span class =\\\"strong\\\">tall</span> man.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I'm <span class =\\\"strong\\\">Colombian</span>.<br/>She's <span class =\\\"strong\\\">Irish</span>.<br/>My eyes are <span class =\\\"strong\\\">green</span>.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "United States"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a country in North America"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm from Cambridge, a town in the United States."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about countries and nationalities."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "American"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person or thing related to the United States."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is American."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Canada"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a country in North America"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My father is from Toronto, Canada."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Canadian"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person or thing related to Canada"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My father is Canadian."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Colombia"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a country in South America"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Bogota is in Colombia."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Colombian"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person or thing related to Colombia"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My friend is Colombian."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Japan"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a country in Asia"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you want to visit Japan?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Japanese"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person or thing related to Japan"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love Japanese food!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Ireland"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a country in Europe"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My mother is from a small town in Ireland."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Irish"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person or thing related to Ireland"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My mother is Irish."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob05aud10"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le01ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Find a picture of your family."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show the picture to your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the people in the picture."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say where each person is from."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask about your partner's family picture."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about where people are from."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe people."}]}], "type": "sena"}